          "question": "Find the area of the minor segment of a circle of radius 7 cm and central angle 90°. (Use $\\pi = 22/7$)",
          "solutionSteps": [
            "Area of Sector $= (90/360) \\times (22/7) \\times 7 \\times 7 = 38.5$ cm².",
            "Area of $\\triangle OAB = 1/2 \\times 7 \\times 7 = 24.5$ cm².",
            "Area of Segment $= 38.5 - 24.5 = 14$ cm²."
          ],
          "finalAnswer": "Ans: 14 cm²"
        },
