          "type": "la",
          "question": "A round table cover has six equal designs as shown in figure. If the radius of the cover is 28 cm, find the cost of making the designs at the rate of ₹0.35 per cm². (Use $\\sqrt{3} = 1.7$)",
          "solutionSteps": [
            "Six equal designs form six segments with $\\theta = 360/6 = 60^{\\circ}$.",
            "Area of one segment $= \\text{Sector} - \\text{Equilateral } \\triangle$.",
